      "paperId": "f0a838d09d01755e841c08dff830063c7c15233d",
      "title": "Music \u2013 Recording \u2013 Aura: Marginal Notes on the Debate between Adorno and Benjamin and on Adorno's Fragmentary Theory of the Gramophone Record",
      "authors": [
